- Input 1 (Th): From EQUATIONS T_Set_Th = 55°C
- Input 2 (Tl): From Type4a output 12 (Average tank temperature) — per task: "lower input temperature Tl connected to tank average temperature"
- Input 3 (Tin): From Type4a output 13 (Temperature of node 1+) — per task: "monitoring temperature Tin connected to tank top temperature". Node 1+ is the top node temperature.
- Input 4 (Input control function): Unconnected (0) — not used
- Input 5 (Upper dead band): From EQUATIONS dT_Upper = 10
- Input 6 (Lower dead band): From EQUATIONS dT_Lower = 0

